   NETWORK, DEC 12-13, 2020},
Organization = {ACL Special Interest Grp Lexicon},
Abstract = {This paper presents the different models submitted by the LT@Helsinki
   team for the SemEval 2020 Shared Task 12. Our team participated in
   sub-tasks A and C; titled offensive language identification and offense
   target identification, respectively. In both cases we used the so-called
   Bidirectional Encoder Representation from Transformer (BERT), a model
   pre-trained by Google and fine-tuned by us on the OLID and SOLID
   datasets. The results show that offensive tweet classification is one of
   several language-based tasks where BERT can achieve state-of-the-art
   results.},
